{"protocol":"mindblown-brain/1","brain":"projects","page":{"id":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew","title":"Tidewatch Beta Crew","type":"project","lobe":"tide","parent":"projects/tidewatch","desc":"Private tester group, release notes and the feedback triage board.","intro":"Private tester group, release notes and the feedback triage board.","created":"2026-10-08","updated":"2026-10-24","synapses":["projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#1","projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#2","projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#3","projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#4","projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#5","projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#6","projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#7","projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#8","projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#9"],"sources":["pplx://sessions/5a8330d1-0058-604a-9fc7-c87be8e5b3e9","pplx://sessions/d7347079-d532-48e0-8f71-99d6f6e5148b","pplx://sessions/b0b7e1a5-010a-2d85-d804-4822b5c0bec0"],"sections":["How it works","See also"]},"url":"https://mindblown.pplx.app/index.html#n=projects%2Ftidewatch-beta-crew","parent":{"id":"projects/tidewatch","title":"Tidewatch","type":"project","lobe":"tide","parent":null,"desc":"Tidewatch is Sam Vale's sailing weather and tide planner for small-boat day trips, with a hosted web app and an offline phone build.","created":"2026-10-08","updated":"2026-10-18","synapses":22,"sources":5,"children":7,"links":13,"url":"https://mindblown.pplx.app/index.html#n=projects%2Ftidewatch","api":"api/projects/v1/pages/projects~2ftidewatch.json"},"children":[],"synapses":[{"id":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#1","page":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew","lead":"Offline cache is not acceptance","text":"Sam chose to keep the offline cache and the crew list distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/5a8330d1-0058-604a-9fc7-c87be8e5b3e9","pplx://sessions/d7347079-d532-48e0-8f71-99d6f6e5148b"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#2","page":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew","lead":"No silent swell model changes","text":"the swell model flags before departure, but this does not establish harbour chart acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/b0b7e1a5-010a-2d85-d804-4822b5c0bec0","pplx://sessions/5a8330d1-0058-604a-9fc7-c87be8e5b3e9"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#3","page":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew","lead":"Harbour chart before crew list","text":"the harbour chart caches at the dock, but this does not establish crew list acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":["entities/nikau-27"],"cites":["pplx://sessions/5a8330d1-0058-604a-9fc7-c87be8e5b3e9","pplx://sessions/b0b7e1a5-010a-2d85-d804-4822b5c0bec0"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#4","page":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew","lead":"Harbour chart survives rollback","text":"the float plan is derived from the harbour chart per harbour; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/b0b7e1a5-010a-2d85-d804-4822b5c0bec0"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#5","page":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew","lead":"Swell model needs an owner choice","text":"swell model changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check before departure is bounded evidence, not proof that the tide gate works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/d7347079-d532-48e0-8f71-99d6f6e5148b","pplx://sessions/5a8330d1-0058-604a-9fc7-c87be8e5b3e9"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#6","page":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew","lead":"Crew list needs an owner choice","text":"Sam chose to keep the crew list and the tide gate distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/tidewatch-passage-planner"],"cites":["pplx://sessions/b0b7e1a5-010a-2d85-d804-4822b5c0bec0"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#7","page":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew","lead":"One crew list, two surfaces","text":"the wind polar is derived from the crew list in the hosted app; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/b0b7e1a5-010a-2d85-d804-4822b5c0bec0","pplx://sessions/5a8330d1-0058-604a-9fc7-c87be8e5b3e9"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#8","page":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew","lead":"Tide gate stays explicit","text":"tide gate changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check per harbour is bounded evidence, not proof that the swell model works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/5a8330d1-0058-604a-9fc7-c87be8e5b3e9"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew#9","page":"projects/tidewatch-beta-crew","lead":"Tide gate rate-limits in the hosted app","text":"tide gate changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check in the hosted app is bounded evidence, not proof that the harbour chart works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/d7347079-d532-48e0-8f71-99d6f6e5148b"]}],"sources":[{"id":"pplx://sessions/5a8330d1-0058-604a-9fc7-c87be8e5b3e9","label":"5a8330d1","kind":"session","pages":["projects/tidewatch","projects/tidewatch-beta-crew","projects/tidewatch-alerts","projects/tidewatch-harbour-cards"]},{"id":"pplx://sessions/d7347079-d532-48e0-8f71-99d6f6e5148b","label":"d7347079","kind":"session","pages":["projects/tidewatch-offline-charts","projects/tidewatch-beta-crew","projects/tidewatch-harbour-cards","entities/nikau-27","projects/orbit-kitchen-recipe-import","projects/hollow-pines-weather-sky","projects/hollow-pines-radio","projects/hollow-pines-performance","projects/hollow-pines-community","projects/garden-ledger","projects/rain-barrel-controller","projects/mail-organization"